msgid "<strong>Cowboy MCP</strong> turns this WordPress site into a <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Model Context Protocol</a> server, so AI coding agents like Claude Code, Codex, and Opencode can read, edit, and manage the whole site through a single authenticated endpoint."
